<section class="slide level2">
<h2>Fermat’s little theorem<img data-src="../../images/Zp.png"
style="max-width: none; width: auto; height:0.3cm" alt="image" /></h2>
<div class="dada-frame-body">
<div class="block">
<div class="block-title">
Observations
</div>
<div class="block-content">
<ul>
<li><span class="dada-font-footnotesize">For<span style="color: blue">
<span class="math inline">p=11</span></span> the value is always <span
style="color: blue"><span class="math inline">1</span> </span> when the
power gets to<span style="color: blue"> <span
class="math inline">10</span></span></span></li>
<li><span class="dada-font-footnotesize">Somtimes the value gets to<span
style="color: blue"> <span class="math inline">1</span> </span>
earlier</span></li>
<li><span class="dada-font-footnotesize">Lengths of runs are always
numbers that divide evenly into <span style="color: blue"><span
class="math inline">10</span></span></span></li>
<li><span class="dada-font-footnotesize">A value of <span
style="color: blue"><span class="math inline">a</span></span> for which
the whole row is needed is called a <span style="color: blue"><span
class="dada-emph">generator</span></span><span
style="color: black">.</span> <span style="color: blue"><span
class="math inline">2</span></span><span style="color: black">,</span>
<span style="color: blue"><span class="math inline">6</span></span><span
style="color: black">,</span> <span style="color: blue"><span
class="math inline">7</span></span><span style="color: black">,
and</span> <span style="color: blue"><span
class="math inline">8</span></span> <span
style="color: black">are</span> <span
style="color: blue">generators</span><span
style="color: black">.</span></span></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="exampleblock">
<div class="block-title">
Simplifying expressions
</div>
<div class="block-content">
<div class="dada-font-footnotesize">
<p>Because<span style="color: blue"> <span
class="math inline">a</span></span> to a power<span style="color: blue">
mod <span class="math inline">p</span></span> always starts <span
style="color: blue">repeating</span> <span style="color: black">after
the power reaches</span><span style="color: blue"> <span
class="math inline">p-1</span></span><span style="color: black">,</span>
you can do this:</p>
</div>
<div class="center">
<div class="dada-font-footnotesize">
<p><span class="roman"> </span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="center">
<div class="dada-font-footnotesize">
<div class="dada-fbox"
style="width: 35%; border: 2px solid black; background-color: white; box-sizing: border-box;">
<div class="center">
<p><span style="color: blue"><span class="math inline">{a^{x}\bmod
p=a^{x\bmod(p-1)}\bmod p}</span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="dada-font-footnotesize">
<p><span style="color: black">Thus modulo </span><span
style="color: blue"><span class="math inline">p</span></span><span
style="color: black"> in the expression requires modulo </span><span
style="color: blue"><span class="math inline">p-1</span></span><span
style="color: black"> in the exponent. For</span><span
style="color: blue"> <span class="math inline">p=13</span></span><span
style="color: black">, then</span></p>
</div>
<div class="center">
<div class="dada-font-footnotesize">
<p><span class="roman"> </span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="center">
<div class="dada-font-footnotesize">
<div class="dada-fbox"
style="width: 50%; border: 2px solid black; background-color: white; box-sizing: border-box;">
<div class="center">
<p><span style="color: blue"><span
class="math inline">{a^{29}\bmod13=a^{29\bmod12}\bmod13=a^{5}\bmod13}</span></span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="slide level2">
<h2>Another example <span
class="math inline">\text{result}=7^{1215}\bmod13</span><img
data-src="../../images/Zp.png" style="max-width: none; width: auto; height:0.3cm" alt="image" /></h2>
<div class="dada-frame-body">
<div class="block">
<div class="block-title">
BIG NUMBER MATHS without calculating big numbers...
</div>
<div class="block-content">
<div class="center">
<div class="dada-fbox"
style="width: 75%; border: 2px solid black; background-color: white; box-sizing: border-box;">
<div class="dada-font-tiny">
<p>6224702750673227370465564559079792689062398648329219130902078771092486991072740587</p>
</div>
<div class="dada-font-tiny">
<p>0651989078101738389949782679348130096777089278266013135577736536148404478380085122</p>
</div>
<div class="dada-font-tiny">
